# Corrections loglan-update makes to the originals when it copies them into
# ~/.loglan/src.  The originals here, and the ones it downloads, are never
# changed themselves.
#
# One correction per line, tab-separated:
#
#     path<TAB>text as published<TAB>text to put in its place
#
# The path is as in MANIFEST.  Every occurrence is replaced; \t and \n stand
# for a tab and a newline, \\ for a backslash.  A correction whose text is no
# longer found -- fixed upstream, perhaps -- is reported and otherwise
# ignored.

# hadja hadje hadji hadjo: written as a composite with every score left at 0/0 (and
# "si" for the dictionary's own "syi"); cited as the other ethnic N-Prims are, by
# the name they come from.
